!=============================================================================!
README by Jungwoo Lee

This is the GOM version update notes.
!=============================================================================!
Rv1.1.1 (GOM_Dv88) -----------------------------------------------------------!
	Error associated with the momentum equation has been fixed.
	This is more stable and accurate than previous versions.
	
Rv1.1.0 (GOM_Dv85) -----------------------------------------------------------!
	Now, I switched [ob_eta_type]:
		1: eta		-> harmonic
		2: harmonic -> eta
	Then, more error control lines have been included in "read_main_inp.f90"
	Following subroutines have been updated:
		read_main_inp.f90
		compute_boundary_eta.f90
	main.inp has been updated:
		C20 & C20_1

Rv1.0.0 (GOM_Dv84) -----------------------------------------------------------!
	This is the first release version.
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------!